WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.513
- Let's go get this money!

00:00:02.604 --> 00:00:03.930
(upbeat music)

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:06.380
- [Host] You might know
the social media app TikTok

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:08.140
for its viral dance videos

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:10.680
or as the distinctly
modern springboard to fame.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.780
- [Tokker] Here's a tax
loophole that actually works.

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:15.330
- [Host] But recently, it's
also become a popular platform

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:17.110
for Millennials and Gen Zers

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:19.810
to put their entrepreneurial
spirit into action.

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:22.480
- You probably won't believe
this really weird side hustle.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.100
- [Host] Whether it's
pitching a side hustle,

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.330
- [Entrepreneur] So
basically, long story short,

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:27.320
I resold gently used clothing.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:28.980
- [Host] Bragging about an ecom business,

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:30.790
- I've made over $1 million on Shopify

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:32.290
and this is how I started.

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:34.860
- [Host] Or documenting
a real estate investment,

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.620
- [Investor] I bought an
entire mobile home park

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:37.830
about a year and a half ago.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:40.960
- [Host] This TikTok subculture
is all about making money.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:43.640
- A super easy way to make money at home.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:46.050
- [Host] Or at least teaching
you how you can, too.

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:48.150
- Here's how to buy your
first house using no bank,

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:49.720
no cash and no credit.

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:52.540
- [Host] Search the hashtag
side hustle or entrepreneur

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:54.580
on TikTok and you'll find yourself

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:56.480
in a vast sea of self help.

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:58.590
- [Jay] How to make $200 per hour

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:00.600
just by removing background images.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.070
- [Host] New entrepreneurs
are getting into everything

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:05.440
from affiliate marketing, investing...

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.850
- Let's do a refresher
on what a dividend is.

00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:10.390
- [Host] No matter the business
model, you can probably find

00:01:10.390 --> 00:01:12.150
someone on TikTok who is doing it.

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:15.500
- You will not believe the
profit of this home flip.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.570
- [Host] According to TikTok,
#entrepreneur has accrued more

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:20.960
than 7.2 billion views.

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:25.060
While #sidehustle has more
than 4.7 billion views.

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:26.870
- This is the business side of TikTok.

00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:28.210
- [Host] So can this corner

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:30.950
of one of the world's most
popular social media apps

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:33.570
actually make you a
successful entrepreneur?

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:37.550
- This is a community of mostly
young people coming together

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:40.110
and saying, how do we make some money?

00:01:40.110 --> 00:01:43.000
- [Host] Nader Alizadeh
is the CEO of Linquia,

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.950
a marketing firm that
specializes in connecting brands

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:47.770
with social media influencers.

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:52.170
- I think if you're a young
person trying to get a job today

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:56.300
versus 12 months ago, it
is significantly harder.

00:01:56.300 --> 00:02:00.810
There's no more opportune
time to be involved in trying

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:03.066
to come up with a side hustle than now.

00:02:03.066 --> 00:02:04.089
- [Interviewer] What
do you do for a living?

00:02:04.089 --> 00:02:04.922
- What do I do for a living?

00:02:04.922 --> 00:02:05.755
- [Interviewer] Yeah, what do you do?

00:02:05.755 --> 00:02:06.588
- I'm a dropshipper.

00:02:06.588 --> 00:02:09.390
- [Host] One popular TikTok
hustle is dropshipping.

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:10.223
- Good morning.

00:02:10.223 --> 00:02:13.240
- That's how 24-year-old
Austin Rabin says he makes

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:16.360
between 30 and $40,000 in profit a month

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:18.130
selling consumer goods.

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:20.990
- I wanted to start just to provide tips

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:21.930
in the ecommerce community

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:23.920
because I know when I was starting out,

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:27.040
I didn't really have any go-to
channel or source that I used

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.270
to answer my questions.

00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:29.900
- [Host] Dropshipping is a business model

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:31.650
that allows online retailers

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:33.360
to sell products to their customers

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:36.570
without ever really stocking
the items themselves.

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:39.780
Instead, when a customer
visits a dropshipper's store,

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:42.130
they're purchasing the
item from a third party

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:45.040
that ships it directly to the customer.

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:47.480
- From there, you'll
typically run advertisements

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.690
to get traffic onto your store.

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:50.350
There's a couple different ways.

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:51.870
One would be Facebook advertisements,

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:52.910
which includes Instagram.

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:54.980
That's really the main
source for dropshippers.

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:56.530
This right here is
probably the number one...

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:58.960
- [Host] Austin started
using TikTok in August.

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:00.660
Since then, he has built his channel

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:05.660
to more than 766,000 likes and
more than 82,000 followers.

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:09.660
Two of his videos have gotten
more than 1 million views.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:12.263
- There's so much organic
reach on TikTok, just the way

00:03:12.263 --> 00:03:14.060
that the whole platform works is insane.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:15.490
I think that's why a lot
of people are attracted

00:03:15.490 --> 00:03:19.030
to the platform because you can
essentially become some sort

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:20.633
of internet sensation overnight.

00:03:21.498 --> 00:03:23.360
(upbeat music)

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:26.330
- [Host] The two primary ways
people make money on TikTok

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:28.160
are through its Creator Marketplace,

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:30.340
which connects TikTokkers with brands.

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:34.130
In its Creator Fund, a
$1 billion pot of money

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:36.590
TikTok is using to pay
its most popular creators

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:37.763
for their views,

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:41.990
but most TikTokkers can't
make a living just off TikTok.

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:44.650
That's because brands
gravitate to the top creators

00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:46.370
with the biggest followings.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.350
And even if their videos rack up tens

00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:50.240
or hundreds of thousands of views,

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:53.540
users report low or inconsistent payouts.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.560
To date, TikTok has not explained

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:59.750
exactly how it calculates
payouts from the Creator Fund.

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:03.610
Rabin said 95% of his income
comes from dropshipping.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:06.640
But thanks to his growing
TikTok audience, he has managed

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.090
to start a variety of small side hustles.

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:10.560
- Link is in my TikTok bio.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:13.380
- [Host] In his TikTok
bio, Rabin provides links

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:17.160
to a variety of promotions,
pre-built dropshipping websites

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:19.460
and access to private consultant services

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:21.510
for those who want to learn how to sell.

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:23.183
- I wanna buy this house for $500,000

00:04:23.183 --> 00:04:26.720
and the bank offered me a
15-year or a 30-year mortgage.

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:29.810
- [Host] That potential to
quickly build a large audience

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:32.510
is also what attracted
another TikTok entrepreneur,

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:34.380
Humphrey Yang to the platform.

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:36.160
Yang specializes in sharing

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:38.420
practical personal finance advice.

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:42.530
- At the end of 2019, I made
a decision to make 30 days

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:45.220
of TikToks in a row, but
by the end of the 30 days,

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:49.170
I had over 120,000 followers
and I just never looked back.

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:50.860
- [Host] Today, Yang's TikTok channel

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:55.630
has 1.1 million followers
and 15.7 million likes.

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:57.690
But he said those numbers aren't enough

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:59.720
to make a living off the platform.

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:02.160
Although he occasionally
does some sponsored posts

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:05.390
on TikTok, Yang said
he sees the app as more

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:07.700
of a marketing tool than a revenue stream.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:12.193
- I do view TikTok as more
of an audience builder,

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:15.570
awareness, top of funnel.

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:17.930
So basically anybody that
sees me for the first time,

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:20.500
they might see me first on
TikTok and then they might get

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:23.090
into my other social
channels, YouTube for example

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.890
or Instagram where they
can learn a little bit more

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:27.680
about finance if they wish.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:30.290
- [Host] Since it launched
in September 2016,

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:33.100
TikTok has seen breakneck
growth, being downloaded

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:36.530
over 2 billion times on the
App Store and Google Play.

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:39.390
Today, it's one of the
web's most downloaded apps

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:42.100
on par with other social
media giants like WhatsApp,

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:44.240
Instagram and Facebook.

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:47.410
TikTok has more than 50
million daily US users

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:50.450
or roughly 15% of the US population.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:51.517
- Building a business
that wasn't even mine.

00:05:51.517 --> 00:05:53.740
- [Host] But the benefits
of getting on TikTok

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:56.180
aren't just the potential
to grow a large audience.

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:58.690
- It's been fantastic for me networking.

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:00.820
So that community that we're talking about

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:03.650
in that specific hashtag,
I've connected with a lot

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:05.930
of those big guys on there
that have similar followings

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:08.650
or bigger followings than
me and they offered me tips

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:10.240
just on the side in a private messages.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:13.570
- I will frequently receive
messages from people saying

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:15.410
that because they watched my videos,

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:17.420
they've decided to take
more responsibility

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:19.697
in their own personal financial life.

00:06:19.697 --> 00:06:22.000
And those are quite
fulfilling to actually see

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.560
that my videos are spurring action.

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:26.620
- Being an influencer
is not for everybody.

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:29.520
This is about independent
of the number of followers

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:33.187
that you have, how can
you go out and make money?

00:06:33.187 --> 00:06:35.183
- [Tokker] $5, $10, $20.

00:06:36.456 --> 00:06:38.923
- So here's a side hustle
that nobody talks about.

